flowchart LR
    Q[Question] --> D[BGE-M3 dense retrieval]
    Q --> V[Vietnamese normalization + Underthesea]
    V --> B[BM25S lexical retrieval]
    D --> R[Reciprocal Rank Fusion]
    B --> R
    R --> K[10 candidates]
    K --> X[BGE reranker v2-m3]
    X --> O[Top 5 contexts]
    O --> C[Cited answer]
